* CABSRT08 - SELECT OUT-OF-BALANCE CONTROL RECORDS
* SORTS THE DAY'S CTLOUT GENERATIONS BY PROGRAM-ID/RUN-ID AND
* KEEPS ONLY THOSE WHERE CT-BAL-IND IS NOT 'B' (BALANCED).
* USED BY CABCTLRP TO BUILD THE RECONCILIATION EXCEPTION
* REPORT - A CLEAN RUN PRODUCES ZERO OUTPUT RECORDS HERE.
*
* THE INCLUDE TESTS COLUMN 40 FOR NOT 'B'.  WHEN CT-BAL-IND
* WAS WIDENED FROM 1 BYTE TO 2 BYTES IN 2014 TO CARRY A
* SEVERITY CODE, THIS CARD WAS NOT UPDATED - IT STILL ONLY
* TESTS THE FIRST BYTE, WHICH HAPPENS TO STILL WORK BUT ONLY
* BY COINCIDENCE OF THE NEW LAYOUT KEEPING 'B' IN COLUMN 40.
 SORT FIELDS=(9,8,CH,A,50,2,CH,A)
 INCLUDE COND=(40,1,CH,NE,C'B')
 OPTION EQUALS
 RECORD TYPE=F,LENGTH=180
